{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CLEAN A BROKEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're an elf that secretly (and efficiently!) cleans spaces for lost critters to move into. Bring good into the world while no one is watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level starts out filthy. Before you arrive, <strong>scope it out</strong> and make a general <strong>plan-of-action</strong>. Once you arrive, you\u2019ve got just a few minutes before anyone shows up. Clean quickly and smartly before anyone arrives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using <strong>clever strategies</strong>, like starting timers early, will help you purge areas faster. <strong>Faster completion \u2192 Better rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/c167e91d4127abe8c203597147475390.poster.avif?t=1754035829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/c167e91d4127abe8c203597147475390.webm?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/c167e91d4127abe8c203597147475390.mp4?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SIMPLY DASHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use water for a powerful <strong>dash</strong>! <strong>Bash</strong> through obstacles, <strong>fly</strong> off ramps, or just <strong>zip</strong> across a level in a flash. Just make sure to spend and refill your water mindfully so you don\u2019t run out when you most need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/563be78ea2587ff89530420f319ffa89.poster.avif?t=1754035829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/563be78ea2587ff89530420f319ffa89.webm?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/563be78ea2587ff89530420f319ffa89.mp4?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SECONDS, PLEASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set <strong>timers</strong> into motion! Many obstacles and objects will take time after you interact with them before they let you through. \u201cStart timers early\u201d ...True, but easier said than done when you\u2019re juggling half a dozen simultaneous tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/f3449346bdfcdc0afbe51c70fd3e06af.poster.avif?t=1754035829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/f3449346bdfcdc0afbe51c70fd3e06af.webm?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/f3449346bdfcdc0afbe51c70fd3e06af.mp4?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE HOMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a professional cleaning elf, you have the special talent to give scared, lost creatures a <strong>warm and safe home</strong>. Be their <strong>guardian of arrival</strong>. Be the hero in the shadows. This game is a loving reminder of the good you can bring into the world when no one is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/288cc9fb3b80d6707969295ca94dbb87.poster.avif?t=1754035829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/288cc9fb3b80d6707969295ca94dbb87.webm?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/extras/288cc9fb3b80d6707969295ca94dbb87.mp4?t=1754035829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPTIMIZERS REJOICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love task/time optimization? Buckle up, buckaroo. Hitting each level\u2019s coveted <strong>platinum time target</strong> will require the cleverest strategies to optimize your route\u2014 and the faster you can finish each level, the better rewards you\u2019ll get!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887060?t=1754035829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887060?t=1754035829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/b9171b4d772dd2881ff59df1efafcfb6d6b7bb55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754035829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887060/b9171b4d772dd2881ff59df1efafcfb6d6b7bb55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754035829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CLEAN A BROKEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're an elf that secretly (and efficiently!) cleans spaces for lost critters to move into. Bring good into the world while no one is watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level starts out filthy. Before you arrive, <strong>scope it out</strong> and make a general <strong>plan-of-action</strong>. Once you arrive, you\u2019ve got just a few minutes before anyone shows up. Clean quickly and smartly before anyo